  "title": "Break the silence for suicide attempt survivors",
  "author": "JD Schramm",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/jd_schramm_break_the_silence_for_suicide_attempt_survivors",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T09:35:59.639899Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T09:35:59.639899Z",
  "lead_time": 21.659,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "all outward appearances",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D13FE8D84",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "From all outward appearances, John had everything going for him.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F121CB67ED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "He had just signed the contract to sell his New York apartment at a six-figure profit, and he'd only owned it for five years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "88E63F1B49",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 169,
        "text": "The school where he graduated from with his master's had just offered him a teaching appointment, which meant not only a salary, but benefits for the first time in ages.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "67ED25DE08",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "And yet, despite everything going really well for John, he was struggling, fighting addiction and a gripping depression.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7330BE387C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 117,
        "endOffset": 135,
        "text": "treacherous waters",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "92485FFEC2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 142,
        "text": "On the night of June 11th, 2003, he climbed up to the edge of the fence on the Manhattan Bridge and he leaped to the treacherous waters below.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68896602B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "Remarkably -- no, miraculously",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35F6226EE9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Remarkably -- no, miraculously -- he lived.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D4445476C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 132,
        "endOffset": 159,
        "text": "drifted down the East River",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C2387EAEA8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 204,
        "endOffset": 238,
        "text": "pathway of the Staten Island Ferry",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4A20AE56F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 425,
        "text": "The fall shattered his right arm, broke every rib that he had, punctured his lung, and he drifted in and out of consciousness as he drifted down the East River, under the Brooklyn Bridge and out into the pathway of the Staten Island Ferry, where passengers on the ferry heard his cries of pain, contacted the boat's captain who contacted the Coast Guard who fished him out of the East River and took him to Bellevue Hospital.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E2152C6E67",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "And that's actually where our story begins.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3AD02E2516",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 79,
        "endOffset": 129,
        "text": "physically, then emotionally, and then spiritually",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D5E363754",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 257,
        "text": "Because once John committed himself to putting his life back together -- first physically, then emotionally, and then spiritually -- he found that there were very few resources available to someone who has attempted to end their life in the way that he did.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6FC71B7708",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "Research shows that 19 out of 20 people who attempt suicide will fail.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "799D43A5B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "But the people who fail are 37 times more likely to succeed the second time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "76C79FCEE0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "This truly is an at-risk population with very few resources to support them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9F7B952BA6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "And what happens",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E567F7556",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "And what happens when people try to assemble themselves back into life, because of our taboos around suicide, we're not sure what to say, and so quite often we say nothing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CA2D147719",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "And that furthers the isolation that people like John found themselves in.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E36989FFD4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "I know John's story very well because I'm John.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CE71609DEF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "I know John's story very well because I'm John.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D5FA9F4DF0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "And this is, today, the first time in any sort of public setting I've ever acknowledged the journey that I have been on.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3EB1A8312A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 148,
        "endOffset": 170,
        "text": "step out of my silence",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "71149A30EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 175,
        "endOffset": 189,
        "text": "past my taboos",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1AC6AC25E4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 190,
        "endOffset": 227,
        "text": "to talk about an idea worth spreading",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8637B3D67B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 28,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "it gets better",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "98F00DDBDD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "It gets way better.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C9ED1A279",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "totally different kind of closet",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "57B49BC06C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 73,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "to encourage you, to urge you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "16905E5A3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 109,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "if you are someone",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0562F5B927",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "It's a conversation worth having and an idea worth spreading.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22E0F53990",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E5EEEDA37",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E333BF463E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}